description:
from colleague- Mr Dafydd Horan (builds and maintains or SQL reporting in BCU Symphony) 

 Can you ask them why not all of the Replicated server tables have data in them, even though there is data in the Live server tables? One example is the dbo.Aud_Attendance_Details table. 

It would be good to get both servers matching as I only really use the Replicated server. As an example, with the above dbo.Aud_Attendance_Details table if I used the Replicated server then it wouldn’t show any records stored in it, whereas if I used Live it would. Hope that makes sense.
